## Why 2013 = Only 2 Records?

> "Chicago started digitizing crash records around 2015-2016. Before that very few records were digitally available. So 2013 has only 2 records and 2014 has only 6 — the dataset was just starting."

---

## Why 2015 = 9,781 and 2016 = 44,078?

> "Data collection was ramping up. 2015 partial digitization started, 2016 more records entered the system. By 2017-2018 the system was fully operational — that's why you see 83,000+ and 118,000+ records."

